Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.09,0:03:21.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(869.2,786.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}AKIHABARA
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,621)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oink It Up!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.4,768.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Starting Today, You're an Akiba Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't bear you not coming, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're 100% wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please check us out, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounce on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a maid cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to come and rest for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real maid cafe girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm really\Nhere in Akiva! Hello, mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:04:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you bring this flyer in with you, you\Nwon't have to pay the service charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come check us out, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely want to go! Meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1241.6,388.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1305.2,634.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1382,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}This Building
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1407.6,830.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}2F
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm! This is it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(478.4,328.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.50,0:04:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(502.8,693.6)\fnPapyrus}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the pigsty, young mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Oink, but we're not open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the new maid starting\Nhere today, Nagomi Wahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the new girl. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:04:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing, can you\Ngo and change, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's so mature looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be so nice to\Nwork with such a pretty maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(621.2,317.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Nagomi Wahira,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(619.4,555.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}use this locker
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.36,0:05:40.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1248,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Manager
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed of\Nwearing a maid outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you I'm Nagomi Wahira I'm here\Nfor the live-in position at the cafe I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,17 years old. I've\Nalways dreamed of being a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cute maid working in a\Ncafe. so i'll do my best
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dream is really to be\Na maid In this day and age?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll manage fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The timing doesn't matter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that you're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're feeling right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should treasure that! I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see the other new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to speak, number\N96, Runco Menon, 35 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny, you're almost 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna hire a 35-year-old rookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her age shouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People can start over however many\Ntimes as long as they're motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we'll have to do\Nour best with the four of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask this, but\Nwhat's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's our panda, Okachi-machi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-kachi-a-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never seen a panda? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an Akiba maid cafe, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you have to have a panda or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not usually, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zitzi-act, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty solid newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're going with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're pressed for\Ntime, so I'm going to open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you two mysteriously\Ndisappear on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll work really hard as\Nif my life depends on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.48,0:07:40.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(910.4,628.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Yumechi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is such a sweet surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing so many handsome\Nmasters sitting here before
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me fills a girl like me\Nup with so much happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be like her one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to give up being human, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's off on a whole other planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my personal recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up being human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, new girls, will you serve these\Noinky-doink drinks to our masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, will do right away, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super duper smooch. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please join me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super, duper, smooch, smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you gotta pump things up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was super pumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky smooch, doinky\Nsmooch, oinky doink doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky smooch, doinky\Nsmooch, oinky doinky doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to nail\Nmy first task as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give up being\Nhuman, just like Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fresh out of Smoochie Ham Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm oinky-doink. Maid Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love eating wittle-bitty acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hobby is relaxing and\Nchatting with my good friend, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very half-picked to\Nmake your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink! Hey! Oink?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's read the manual properly, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us send you off, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again! Bye! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will try even\Nharder, so please bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't make trouble for my\Nregulars and you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally get to be a maid and\Nthere's no time to be discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the pigsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, perhaps this is your\Nfirst visit to the maid cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be\Nnervous about it, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I just started\Nas a maid today myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your oinky-doink water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drinking too much will turn you into\Na widow piglet, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you drink too much,\Nyou'll turn into a piglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I see you over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do believe you're a little behind on\Ndelivering those party favors you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, those do's aren't do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you please give us a\Nlittle more time, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really not understand your\Nplace in this situation here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason swine-like\Nyou are in business is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of your affiliation\Nwith the Creatureland Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you truly understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then those words wouldn't be coming\Nout of your mouth, now would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very much aware of that, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me see you pinch out those do's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try squeezing harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't deliver the\Ngoods, I'll take that mate there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can be the one to handle\Nthe wuv wuv moonbeam issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't have her do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She literally just joined our pen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to squeeze some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can wait Hey, Nagomi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to do a very\Nimportant job for us Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything for the cafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416,353.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.8,585.4)\fnPapyrus}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, I want you to go deliver\Nsomething to the Wuv Wuv Moonbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wuv Wuv Moonbeam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a maid cafe, one that happens to be\Nrun by our parent company's competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I want you to go over\Nthere and hand them this envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An envelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this\Nfor us, please? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate asking you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super sorry. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, Ronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me accompany\Nher on this errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't think you should\Ntack along on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a good experience\Nfor the newbies to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you leave, you two should get\Nyourself something nice to eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pork broth ramen\Ndownstairs is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(675,358.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}RAMEN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, one soy milk tofu skin ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen, extra veggies, topped with\Nsauce, fat, and a load of garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, same as ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi's oinky-doink drink is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really envy her skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess she has a special\Nway of infusing it with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to try harder so I\Ncan be of use to the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:14:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's really amazing\Nthat you're a maid at 35, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duly received.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they'll make it back safely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares if they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both majorly suck as maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's cold, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you two believe in miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A future where those two are smiling,\Nwallowing around like cute piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why are you making a new hire flyer?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.69,0:14:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(484.8,524.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Urgently hiring new maids!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.66,0:14:55.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(611.2,222)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(868.8,596)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Hop on over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(761.4,545.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Five more hops
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to speak, number 96.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Ronko Manon from Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagomi Wahira.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here on an errand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me check and see if\Nmy manager is available.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently their theme\Nis rabbits on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hop on in and wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just chop it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight from the fucking ribs, goddammit!
